I've been playing with my pet Olog-hai for a while, and have noticed some
rather strange behavior (I love scrolls of taming ;-).  I also have a
stethoscope, and I've been watching my pet's hit points.  

He seems to lose incredible amounts of hit points for no reason.  Right
now he has HPMAX=365.  I ran into a rope golem, and decided to let him
kill it for me.  Before the combat started he had HP=341(365).  I kept
very careful watch of who hit who during the combat.  My pet WAS NOT
hit once.  Yet after the combat, when I applied the stethoscope again,
HP=151(367).  The increase in HPMAX is consistent with previous behavior;
i.e., whenever my pet kills something, his HPMAX increases a little bit.

I was wondering if anybody has an explanation for this behavior.  

BTW, I was playing vanilla pl9, on a microvax running ULTRIX 3.2.

